  << /ActualText (I\031m a full\055stack creator bridging web development\054 design and CSS skills\056 I started as a graphic designer before studying computer science and digital humanities\056\n\nI am curiosity\055driven\054 detail\055oriented\056 I plan\054 test\054 iterate\054 and refine across the product\031s life\055cycle\054 from design to QA\056 My goal is to define design choices that produce less and cleaner code\054 to proactively prevent bugs and unlock new features with ease\056\n\nI always aim to balance usability\054 beauty and do\055ability when I build apps\054 systems\054 components and tools in order to empower users and developers\056\nBetter workflows for teams and more consistent and enjoyable products\056)
